  "description": "Sri Lanka quarterly income tax instalments under section 90 of the Inland Revenue Act No. 24 of 2017 for the year of assessment 2026/27 (1 April 2026 to 31 March 2027). Covers who is an instalment payer, the new prior-year basis from 1 April 2026, the A minus C over B formula, the four due dates, credit for tax withheld, the 10% late instalment penalty and 1.5% monthly interest. Use for questions on provisional tax, quarterly tax, advance income tax instalments, SET or statement of estimated tax in Sri Lanka.",
